* NEB test case; CAM protein;  trajectory genration based on internal coordinate interpolation.
* 

set nrep 24


set version 19

set psffile 1exr
set ID cam
set crddir ./
set nmini1 10  ! number of minimizations in replica generation
set nmini2 10  ! number of minimizations in replica generation

open unit 1 read form name "toph19.inp"
read rtf card unit 1
close unit 1

open unit 1 read form name "param19.inp"
read param card unit 1
close unit 1
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! PSF
open read form unit 1 name @psffile.psf
read psf card unit 1
close unit 1
!
rename segid @ID select segid 1EXR end

!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! ENDPOINT COORDINATES!!!!!!!!!!!
open read form unit 1 name ./@{ID}1_min.CRD
open read form unit 2 name ./@{ID}2_min.CRD
read coor card unit 1  
read coor comp card unit 2
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

coor orie rms
update cutnb 14.0 rdie vswitch shift
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

! sequentially create & minimize replicas
! create first replica
REPLicate S nrep 1 select segid @ID END   ! coordinates are copied automatically
delete atom select segid @ID end          ! delete main part

!!!!!!!!!!! WRITE FIRST REPLICA !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
  write coor card      select segid S1 end name @crddir/@ID_1.crd
!!!!!!!!!!! WRITE LAST REPLICA !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
calc last = @nrep + 2
  write coor comp card select segid S1 end name @crddir/@ID_@last.crd


set linear ( type N .or. type C .or. type CA )  ! linearly interpolate the backbone

nobomb ! don't bomd on empty selections

ic gene ! generate ic table entries
ic fill ! fill ic table from main coordinates

! shrink the side chain bonds (fischer's approach) & rebuild structures

ic fill ! fill ic table from main coordinates
set bsc 0.5
ic scale bond @bsc

coor init select .not. @linear end
if ?nsel eq ?natom ic seed 1 CA 1 C 2 N  ! if all atoms were initialized, need to seed before build
ic build
!
ic fill comp ! re-fill ic table from comparison coordinates
set bsc 0.5
ic scale bond @bsc
coor init select .not. @linear end comp
if ?nsel eq ?natom ic seed 1 CA 1 C 2 N comp ! if all atoms were initialized, need to seed before build
ic build comp

label skip_scale

set i 1
label loop_rep

ic diff comp ! put IC_comp - IC_main

calc scale = 1 / (@nrep - @i + 2)

set bsc @scale
set asc @scale
set dsc @scale
set isc @scale
set  a  @scale
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
ic scale bond @bsc angle @asc dihe @dsc impr @isc
ic fill append ! append to existing values : main = main +  scale * ( comp - main )

coor average fact @a select @linear .and. segid S1 end ! main = a * comp + (1-a) * main
coor init select .not. @linear end
if ?nsel eq ?natom ic seed 1 CA 1 C 2 N  ! if all atoms were initialized, need to seed before build
ic build
!
coor orie rms mass

 calc k = @i+1
 write coor card select segid S1 end name @crddir/@ID_@k.crd

 incr i by 1
 if @i le @nrep -
goto loop_rep





